From: VPN Guardian maintainers
Subject: dnsmasq: native regex upstream selectors with ordinary DNS bypass

Keeps native suffix matching and all DHCP functions. Regex selectors are
compiled per candidate config and freed during replacement/removal. Failed
reloads retain the active policy; match errors refuse rather than leak DNS.
Match canonical escaped query names; native explicit/local rules keep priority.

